<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Ireland's NTMA says 100mln punt 5-yr tap exhausted.</title>
<headline>Ireland's NTMA says 100mln punt 5-yr tap exhausted.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) said on Tuesday that its 100 million punt tap issue in the 6.5 percent bond due 2001 was all sold.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9775</p>
